Answer: Yes, the daughters of President Buhari and Vice President Osinbajo publicly supported the #EndSARS protests in October 2020. According to a report, Zahra Buhari and Kiki Osinbajo both shared an image with the hashtag #EndPoliceBrutality on their Instagram stories, with the article stating that "Zahra posted one of the viral images... The same image was uploaded by Kiki Osinbajo."

Source URL: https://dailypost.ng/2020/10/10/end-sars-zahra-buhari-kiki-osinbajo-join-protest/

